{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51065","headline":"题石水涧 · 陈抟","name":"题石水涧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"银河洒落翠光冷，一派回环[湛]（淡）晚晖。\n几恨却爲顽石尵，琉璃滑处玉花飞。\n（见《宋诗纪事》卷五引明李蔉辑《宋艺圃集》。\n）（见《宋艺圃集》卷一，又见《增修诗话总龟》卷四四引《翰府名谈》。\n「淡」，二书皆作「湛」，今据改。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈抟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}